<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0683_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Billy</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m researchin’ Block Bosses for a\nproject at school!\rI know where they go. When they go.\nWhat they eat.\fIt’s for SCHOOL.\rAyo, we should swap numbers! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Block Bosses’ spots and times change,\nso I’ll hit your phone!\fI’m always watchin’. For the PROJECT.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Huh? You don’t wanna know nothin’\nabout Block Bosses? You ain’t curious?\fI’m VERY curious.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I KNEW you’d wanna know about the\nBlock Bosses! {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ayo, you right nearby, ain’t you?\nSo we should talk face-to-face!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Whitney like to chill on the sixth floor\nof the Goldenrod Dept. Store.\fShe order the same smoothie every\ntime.\fStrawberry. Extra ice.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Janine bring dinner to her pops every\nevenin’. Find her at the Big League\fReception Gate in the late afternoon!\fIt’s always soup.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Falkner like to hit Celadon City on\nMondays, it seem.\fHe buys birdseed. 40 pounds of it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Seem like Misty REALLY like Route 25!\rEvery night she watch the sunset.\nAlone. Sighin’.\fI’m takin’ notes. For school.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sabrina like the port in Olivine on\nFriday nights.\rShe pop up in the WEIRDEST places.\fShe looked RIGHT at me. She knew.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Maybe I should only tell you this...\rTruth is, Jasmine kinda EAT!\rHit the Olivine Café past noon and\nyou’ll run into her for SURE!\fShe gets three desserts.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Cinnabar’s Blaine think a LOT about his\ntown, you know?\rEvery Tuesday mornin’ he sit where the\nCinnabar Block was and think.\fSometimes he cries. I don’t intrude.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pewter’s Brock REALLY love rocks!\rHe go in DIGLETT’s Cave every day past\nnoon.\fHe talks to the rocks. They don’t\ftalk back. Yet.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Bugsy go lookin’ for Bug-type homies.\nHe even go as far as Viridian Forest!\fHe sleeps out there sometimes.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pryce a man of refined taste, don’t you\nagree?\rEvery mornin’ at seven he go out alone\nand stare at the Lake of Rage.\fFor two hours. I timed it.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Morty ALWAYS starin’ at the Bell Tower,\nain’t he?\rHe been locked in on that ONE thing. To\nthe point he became a Block Boss.\fAnd got a restrainin’ order. From a\nbird.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I REALLY gotta work on my trainin’.\nLet’s scrap again, OK? I’ll be\fwaitin’ on {STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Is that aight?\nWe finna scrap again on\f{STRVAR_1 4, 3, 0}! Hurry up already!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0683_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">If anythin’ about the Block Bosses\nchange, I’ll hit you up!\fI’ll know first. I ALWAYS know first.</language>
	</row>
</body>
